{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2013a.q24.material.recovered", "text": "美国心理学家曾做过一项有趣的试验：把两辆一模一样的汽车分别停放在两个不同的街区，一辆完好地停放在一个中产阶级集聚的街区，另一辆则摘掉车牌、打开顶棚，停放在相对杂乱的街区。结果发现停放在中产阶级集聚街区的那一辆过了一个星期还完好无损．而打开顶棚的那一辆，不到一天就被偷走了。于是，该研究者把完好无损的那辆汽车敲碎一块玻璃。结果发现，刚过了几个小时，这辆汽车就不见了。因此，有研究者以该试验为基础，提出了著名的“破窗理论”。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "543893b8cacbbd24a74711ff69104e5a56b97d185176c1273c7cf417794d48dc", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1507, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1717, "next_source_question_number": 24, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 24, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "543893b8cacbbd24a74711ff69104e5a56b97d185176c1273c7cf417794d48dc"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2013a.q24"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m1.k01", "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m3.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.manage", "ntce.xiaoxue.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.202.r006", "ntce.outline.202.r020", "ntce.outline.202.r022"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2013a.q24"], "word_count": 210, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "jiaoxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "543893b8cacbbd24a74711ff69104e5a56b97d185176c1273c7cf417794d48dc", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1507, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1717, "next_source_question_number": 24, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "