{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2013a.q27.material.recovered", "text": "请认真阅读下列材料，并按要求作答。 在进行“三角形面积”教学时，指导面积计算公式一般采用两种方法：一种是把两个完全一样的三角形拼成一个平行四边形(见图1)，另一个是利用三角形中位线剪拼成平行四边形(见图2-1)或折叠成长方形(见图2-2)。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "543893b8cacbbd24a74711ff69104e5a56b97d185176c1273c7cf417794d48dc", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2283, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2403, "next_source_question_number": 27, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "543893b8cacbbd24a74711ff69104e5a56b97d185176c1273c7cf417794d48dc"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2013a.q27"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m4.k01", "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m5.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.202.r028", "ntce.outline.202.r029", "ntce.outline.202.r037"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2013a.q27"], "word_count": 120, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "jiaoxue", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "543893b8cacbbd24a74711ff69104e5a56b97d185176c1273c7cf417794d48dc", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2283, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2403, "next_source_question_number": 27, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "543893b8cacbbd24a74711ff69104e5a56b97d185